Criqa
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 92 ROTATE 1 2 U
IKOUR 3 FACE_ALL
IKOUR 9 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE IKOUR IKOUR
DEST Rank 1
MOVE DRAW IKOUR
DEST Size > 3
MOVE_STACK IKOUR IKOUR
AND
    OR
        DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
        SRCSTACK Rank descending
    AND
        SRCSTACK Suit match_color
        SRC Suit {CLUBS}
$win
PILE ALL IKOUR Empty
